## 8. Try an incremental load

Run `08_incremental_load_demo/01_incremental_customer_999998.py`.

It adds one customer record to the landing folder, runs the layers, and compares
row counts before and after. Bronze, Silver and Gold should each go up by the
same amount, and the notebook raises an error if any layer did not move.

This is the fastest way to show that Auto Loader is genuinely incremental instead
of reloading everything.

